+Small values of both variables are typically found in simulated multijet events.
+In signal events, large $\met$ can be produced by neutrinos even when a much softer jet lies nearby in $\phi$.
 
 Events are therefore retained if
 \begin{equation}
     \min\Delta\phi(j,\met)>0.4 \quad\text{or}\quad \frac{\met}{\minDphiJetPt}>6.
     \label{eq:ch7_qcd_cut}
 \end{equation}
