+Events are required to pass the lowest-threshold unprescaled $\met$ trigger, with $\met>200~\GeV$ imposed offline to ensure full trigger efficiency.
+Exactly one signal $\tau$ is required, and events with a selected electron or muon are vetoed.
+The multijet suppression requirement in Eq.~\ref{eq:ch7_qcd_cut} is also applied.
+For the one-$b$-jet signal regions ($\bTagSR$), exactly one $b$-tagged jet is required, while at least one jet and no $b$-tagged jets are required in $\bVetoSR$.
 
